  "description": "Test an application that uses Authio without an Authio server: an in-memory fake Authio served through an HttpMessageHandler (discovery, JWKS, the authorization endpoint with PKCE and web_message, every token grant, ID tokens with nonce and at_hash, JWE to a client's own key, introspection, revocation, userinfo, end session, back-channel logout delivery, device flow and Admin API stubs), a token factory and builder for crafting any token, and a manual clock.",
